n us for the FALL 2026 ARTbus.**\n\n(We rent a BUS--ok its a **yellow school bus**--but it works!) Hence the $20 price!\n\n**$20 per person** at the *link below. (By signing up--signals to me that you've purchased your $20 ticket--LET me know via Meetup email)*\n\nWould you like to join in this next one/upcoming? **Saturday October 24th. (11am-5:30pm)**\n\nThis will be incredible afternoon!! International artists. Lovely reception and opening comments.\n\n**We'll begin** the afternoon at a Gallery opening at Bloor/Lansdowne, before heading to Mississauga and Oakville\n\nLet someone else DRIVE while we enjoy socializing and ART learning.\n\n**Reserve your own seat ($20)** and enjoy an inspiring afternoon across three leading art institutions.\n\nWe finish the day at Gairloch Gardens--(right on Lake Ontario) and a nice reception for us (wine/cheese)\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/visit\n\n**TICKET link here (with all details)--**\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/artbus_2026_fall\n\nPlease be on TIME. Plan ahead.\n\nYou should be inside the first gallery by 11:15am. BUS will leave at 12 noon.\n\nSee you there.","startDate":"2026-10-24T15:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Patel Brown","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"21 Wade Ave Unit 2, Toronto, ON M6H 1P4, Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-arts-and-culture/"},"performer":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Franchise Canada Show Toronto — Fall 2026 (Saturday)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-tech-hangout/events/315999062/","description":"Ready to become your own boss—but